  "_comment": [
    "Where every battle animation comes from. build_sheets.py turns this into assets/art/anim/*.png and assets/anim/clips.json.",
    "units.<unit>.<action>: job = PixelLab animate_image_pixminimax job (frame 0 is the original sprite, 1..N are generated),",
    "frames = which of those to keep in play order (drop frames that drew effects into the picture: skill effects are separate images),",
    "fps or durations (seconds) = timing, loop = whether the clip repeats.",
    "effects.<name>: export = vfx_workbench export id, file = its file stem. images.<name>: a single picture played as a one-frame clip.",
    "Every job was generated from assets/art/<unit>.png at 64x64, direction south, view low top-down (see tools/anim/README.md)."
  ],
